ght, the more random skills you can learn from them, letting you to build your concubine &amp; companions with unique skill trees. Swords, daggers, maces, bows &amp; spells are your weapons choices, as well as special weapons like whips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/5ade5bf681fec00497550cbff0b06cf7.webp?t=1784227956\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/85d93a48ad09b78f39870b620f88a7b5.poster.avif?t=1784227956\" width=776 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/85d93a48ad09b78f39870b620f88a7b5.webm?t=1784227956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/85d93a48ad09b78f39870b620f88a7b5.mp4?t=1784227956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your map to travel to monumental buildings, palaces, temples &amp; underground crypts of Istanbul. Unlock new areas by following the epic story line, or fight in random instances to equip your concubine &amp; copanions. The treasures of medieval Istanbul will gift you with virtually endless armor, weapons, costumes,  accessories &amp; skills to loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/5ade5bf681fec00497550cbff0b06cf7.webp?t=1784227956\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/27710e41d9c46b6e6e5394188eda05c9.poster.avif?t=1784227956\" width=776 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/27710e41d9c46b6e6e5394188eda05c9.webm?t=1784227956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/27710e41d9c46b6e6e5394188eda05c9.mp4?t=1784227956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you travel &amp; fight your way, you will meet beautiful, skilled companions to rescue &amp; add to your party. Customize your new companions, gear &amp; costume them up, build their skill trees &amp; teach them new spells &amp; strategies. Your companions will also live in your Harem base, and you can see them in their daily routines -sleeping, bathing, entertaining- when you are not outside adventuring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/5ade5bf681fec00497550cbff0b06cf7.webp?t=1784227956\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/a557ef08e6b3171b73c20b8926eeb446.poster.avif?t=1784227956\" width=776 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/a557ef08e6b3171b73c20b8926eeb446.webm?t=1784227956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/a557ef08e6b3171b73c20b8926eeb446.mp4?t=1784227956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Free Pose Mode lets you strike the perfect pose anywhere in your palace or in cleared instances to capture stunning shots, while Photo Mode allows you to pause mid-combat, adjust the camera, lighting, and focus, so you can immortalize your most epic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/5fb5ee9389232525e63a4feeb551a839.webp?t=1784227956\" width=152 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/b743f5b718f09e48b52f9a11e4315400.avif?t=1784227956\" width=771 height=550 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A sensual, dark fantasy hack &amp; slash ARPG. Fully customize an attractive concubine and up to three female companions with deep cosmetic details. Be the private assassin of the Sultan and earn sexy outfits, powerful weapons &amp; mystic skills. Design &amp; customize your Harem base at the Grand Palace.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/c344577dc3450f1376a694f5849c76408628936a/header.jpg?t=1784227956", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/7474b6006604a5f7d071bce5f103efdf9abfa7b3/capsul